{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99806","id":2206288492,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DgUps","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99806","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99806.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99806.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99806","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99806/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99806/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99806/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/10e14e0c9071751536a4148a46c9a5ed47b933a7","number":99806,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Soft-deprecate the use of implicit reliance on `NULL`-terminated strings.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\"MVP\" of addressing https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11249 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11258. The motivation for this direction are discussed there (and linked issues). This PR _does not change assumptions_ about user-supplied strings; `NULL` termination checks are just offloaded to compile-time for static strings supplied from the codebase.\r\n\r\nThis change is toggled with the c++-define `GODOT_SHOW_STR_DEPRECATIONS` (off by default). For unowned string references, `StrRange` can be used, which avoids allocation overhead. This is already employed in `sprintf` and `operator+` in this PR, because there are _a lot_ of uses of these functions.\r\n\r\nThis change is as minimal as I could realistically get it to be: `ustring` has quite a lot of changes, but most other files work exactly as before. This changes when `GODOT_SHOW_STR_DEPRECATIONS` is toggled: Suddenly, the console explodes into a flurry of warnings, because `strlen` is used in a place where it may be inappropriate and wastes CPU cycles.\r\n\r\nThis PR should already slightly improves performance by letting callers pass their `string[]` as `string[]` with known lengths, rather than having it recomputed immediately. Every change we will make to get rid of another `GODOT_SHOW_STR_DEPRECATIONS` deprecation warning will improve the engine speed further. Every function we can make refactor to use `StrRange` instead of String will reduce allocations and improve engine speed.\r\n\r\nPlease, participate in lively discussion! I realize merging this is kind of a large ask, especially from a pretty fresh contributor like myself. I tried to make the change as unopinionated as possible, and focused on just improving speed and conditions for future PRs to improve speed further.\r\n\r\nStill, I personally think this direction is unavoidable sooner or later, if we want to make the best use of clock cycles for the hard parts elsewhere. Also, i have heard it mentioned a few times that the Godot source code has a side-mission as a learning tool - making computation explicit to avoid accidental promotions and data copies is very important in clean and fast code :)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-11-28T19:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T19:05:14Z","closed_at":"2026-05-12T19:05:06Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ivorforce:string-deprecate-null-term","ref":"string-deprecate-null-term","repo":{"id":861387944,"node_id":"R_kgDOM1e8qA","name":"godot","full_name":"Ivorforce/godot","owner":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/g